      "title": "Vacancies sorted by position title",
      "description": "Vacant administrative and technical positions at UiO - University of Oslo Jump to main content UiO University of Oslo No En Menu For employees My studies Search our webpages Search Home Research Studies Student life Services and tools About UiO People Sub menu About UiO Vacancies at UiO Vacant academic positions at UiO Vacant administrative and technical positions at UiO About UiO > Vacancies at UiO > Vacant administrative and technical positions at UiO Norwegian version of this page Vacant administrative and technical positions at UiO We offer our administrative and technical employees exciting professional challenges in a dynamic and internationally oriented environment. Employees at all levels shall be able to unfold and develop their talent in a professionally run organisation. Get employed at UiO! Working at UiO Hiring process for administrative and technical positions Our International Staff Mobility Office offers relocation support Contact Do you have questions about a position or are you stuck in the application portal? See who can help you Vacancies sorted by unit Faculty of Educational Sciences Faculty of Dentistry Faculty of Humanities Faculty of Law Faculty of Mathematics and Natural Sciences Faculty of Medicine Faculty of Social Sciences Faculty of Theology Centre for Global Sustainability Natural History Museum Museum of Cultural History University Center for Information Technology Centre for Development and the Environment Centre for Gender Research International Summer School (ISS) Vacancies sorted by position title Contact information Contact us Find us About the website Cookies Accessibility statement (in Norwegian only) Responsible for this page Managing editor UiO Log in"
